(Two seats on the panel.) Tj
0 -4 Td
() Tj
0 -3 Td
(Seat 1  mechanical challenger. Always runs. Zero models. Eight checks \(C1C8\): coverage,) Tj
0 -3 Td
(lineage span, single-lineage concentration, uncited contradiction, confidence mismatch, weak) Tj
0 -3 Td
(steps, quote concentration, measurement validity. Shares no weights or training data with) Tj
0 -3 Td
(the proposer because it isn't a model. Independence is a property of the code, not a) Tj
0 -3 Td
(calibration. This is the only seat whose independence we can guarantee.) Tj
0 -4 Td
() Tj
0 -3 Td
(Seat 2  model challenger \(optional\). Sees the conclusion, not the reasoning \(blind\). Picked) Tj
0 -3 Td
(via models/registry.json. Only counts as independent if weight lineage is verified different) Tj
0 -3 Td
(from the proposer's. Same family = second call, not second source.) Tj
0 -4 Td
() Tj
0 -3 Td
(Verdicts \(computed, not declared\):) Tj
0 -4 Td
() Tj
0 -3 Td
(Verdict  ·  Meaning) Tj
0 -3 Td
(`unverified`  ·  Citation check failed. Done.) Tj
0 -3 Td
(`unsubstantiated`  ·  Every step cited without quoting.) Tj
0 -3 Td
(`verified_unchallenged`  ·  Citations ok; no challenge ran.) Tj
0 -3 Td
(`verified`  ·  Citations ok; challenges found nothing.) Tj
0 -3 Td
(`contested`  ·  Two or more independent lineages objected.) Tj
0 -4 Td
() Tj
0 -3 Td
